{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015162036292-1015_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261015193127\"/><p>救援人員抵達學校。</p><p>巴基斯坦西北部城市白沙瓦周四（15日）發生學校屋頂坍塌事故，造成至少35人死亡。救援行動已經結束，目前已成立一個委員會調查事故原因。</p><p>警方已逮捕校長，開伯爾-普什圖省省長要求就此事件提交詳細報告。總統扎爾達里強調，必須全面調查，確定事故原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:40:01.401429+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:20:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:55.583851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:56.000151+00:00","content_hash":"7616c5ac794c775e6cc3b7a57bdf8d3a80f56098a963a229ef805d526aede986","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}